       <item>
        <widget class="QLabel" name="label_23">
         <property name="text">
          <string>BactFit fits an ideal (rod shaped) cell model to the segmentations. Each cell model has a polynomial midline and a radius parameter, where the cell outline is a fixed radius from the midline. Cell models can be created by fitting cell models to segmentations, or drawing a midline and interploating the outline.</string>
         </property>
